 wrong route · open if you want a warning</summary><div class="g9-secondary-body"><div class="g9-block" data-g9-block="common_wrong_route"><h4>Common wrong route</h4><p>Treating the ranges as velocities without first establishing the common fall time.</p></div></div></details></div><div class="g9-component g9-c-attempt" data-g9-component="ATTEMPT" data-g9-level="REQUIRED" data-g9-presentation="ATTEMPT"><div class="g9-attempt" data-g9-attempt-box data-g9-response-type="free_response"><label>Your answer<textarea data-g9-attempt rows="4"></textarea></label><label class="g9-paper"><input data-g9-paper type="checkbox">I worked this on paper</label><button type="button" data-g9-commit>I have attempted this</button></div></div></section></div><div class="g9-col g9-col-support"><section class="blueprint-slot slot-representation" data-blueprint-slot="representation" data-required="false"></section><section class="blueprint-slot slot-support" data-blueprint-slot="support" data-required="false"><div class="g9-component g9-c-ladder" data-g9-component="HINT_LADDER" data-g9-level="REQUIRED" data-g9-presentation="LADDER" data-g9-component-items="3"><details class="g9-secondary-disclosure" data-g9-secondary="core2-hints"><summary>Need a hint? · guided support</summary><div class="g9-secondary-body"><div class="g9-eyebrow">Hint ladder · reveal only what you need</div><div class="g9-block" data-g9-block="authored_core2_support"><h4>Guided support</h4><div class="g9-ladder" data-g9-ladder-ref="CORE2-PYQ-PHY-IITJEE-2011-P2-Q26-AUTHORED_CORE2_PROMPT_REVEAL" data-g9-support-group="AUTHORED_CORE2_PROMPT_REVEAL"><ol data-g9-ladder></ol><ol class="g9-rung-map" aria-label="Rungs still to come"><li data-g9-rung-ghost><div class="g9-rung-head"><span class="g9-rung-no">H0</span><span class="g9-rung-label" data-g9-support-stage-label>Represent</span><span class="g9-pill g9-pill-guided">Guided</span></div></li><li data-g9-rung-ghost><div class="g9-rung-head"><span class="g9-rung-no">H1</span><spa